                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a pretty good puzzle game, I like the calming OST, the visuals are simple but pretty and not distracting from the puzzle process. But I can't recommend it because of the bugs- the flipping mechanic where your character flips from one side of the screen to the other is quite buggy now and then, leading to characters disappearing, clipping through objects, falling through floors, and so on. In the final series of puzzles my character somehow disappeared and I wasn't able to get him to reappear. When I went back to the main menu it turns out my progress in that chapter was just completely reset...",
